## Scenario 2: Create Multiple Security Groups Dynamically

**Requirement:**
Create Security Groups:

* web
* app
* db

### Solution

```hcl
variable "sg_names" {
  default = ["web", "app", "db"]
}

resource "aws_security_group" "sg" {
  for_each = toset(var.sg_names)

  name = each.value
}
```

