## Scenario 3: Create Multiple S3 Buckets

**Requirement:**
Create:

* company-dev
* company-qa
* company-prod

### Solution

```hcl
variable "bucket_names" {
  default = [
    "company-dev",
    "company-qa",
    "company-prod"
  ]
}

resource "aws_s3_bucket" "bucket" {
  for_each = toset(var.bucket_names)

  bucket = each.value
}
```

