## Scenario 5: Create Resources Across Multiple Regions

**Requirement:**
Create EC2 instances in:

* us-east-1
* us-west-2

### Solution

```hcl
provider "aws" {
  region = "us-east-1"
}

provider "aws" {
  alias  = "west"
  region = "us-west-2"
}

resource "aws_instance" "east" {
  ami           = "ami-123456"
  instance_type = "t2.micro"
}

resource "aws_instance" "west" {
  provider      = aws.west
  ami           = "ami-123456"
  instance_type = "t2.micro"
}
```

