## Scenario 6: Dynamic Security Group Rules

**Requirement:**
Open ports:

* 22
* 80
* 443

### Solution

```hcl
variable "ports" {
  default = [22, 80, 443]
}

resource "aws_security_group" "web" {
  name = "web-sg"

  dynamic "ingress" {
    for_each = var.ports

    content {
      from_port   = ingress.value
      to_port     = ingress.value
      protocol    = "tcp"
      cidr_blocks = ["0.0.0.0/0"]
    }
  }
}
```

