## Scenario 7: Remote State Backend

**Requirement:**
Store Terraform state in S3 and use DynamoDB for locking.

### Solution

```hcl
terraform {
  backend "s3" {
    bucket         = "terraform-state-bucket"
    key            = "prod/terraform.tfstate"
    region         = "us-east-1"
    dynamodb_table = "terraform-locks"
  }
}
```

