## Scenario 8: Create IAM Users from a List

**Requirement:**
Create:

* dev1
* dev2
* dev3

### Solution

```hcl
variable "users" {
  default = ["dev1", "dev2", "dev3"]
}

resource "aws_iam_user" "user" {
  for_each = toset(var.users)

  name = each.value
}
```

