## Scenario 9: Reusable EC2 Module

**Requirement:**
Use one module to create Dev and Prod servers.

### Root Module

```hcl
module "dev" {
  source        = "./modules/ec2"
  instance_name = "dev-server"
}

module "prod" {
  source        = "./modules/ec2"
  instance_name = "prod-server"
}
```

### Module

```hcl
resource "aws_instance" "server" {
  ami           = "ami-123456"
  instance_type = "t2.micro"

  tags = {
    Name = var.instance_name
  }
}
```

