## Scenario 10: Create EC2 Instances from a Map

**Requirement:**

| Name | Type      |
| ---- | --------- |
| web  | t2.micro  |
| app  | t3.medium |
| db   | t3.large  |

### Solution

```hcl
variable "instances" {
  default = {
    web = "t2.micro"
    app = "t3.medium"
    db  = "t3.large"
  }
}

resource "aws_instance" "server" {
  for_each = var.instances

  ami           = "ami-123456"
  instance_type = each.value

  tags = {
    Name = each.key
  }
}
```

